WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:02.760
- [Ann] Vladimir Putin's private life,

00:00:02.760 --> 00:00:04.090
or the wealth he owns,

00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:06.193
are closely guarded secrets.

00:00:07.440 --> 00:00:09.300
As the war in Ukraine continues,

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:12.360
this has made it a challenge
for the US and Western allies

00:00:12.360 --> 00:00:14.900
to target Putin and his inner circle,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.440
directly with sanctions,

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.600
but that hasn't stopped them

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:21.410
from trying to impose them on
him and two of his daughters.

00:00:21.410 --> 00:00:23.603
- President Putin and Russian oligarchs

00:00:23.603 --> 00:00:27.940
stash assets and resources
in the bank accounts

00:00:27.940 --> 00:00:29.680
of their family members.

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.800
And so this was an effort
to get at those assets.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.730
- Here's what we know about
the Russian president's family

00:00:35.730 --> 00:00:37.396
and their assets.

00:00:37.396 --> 00:00:39.210
Unlike Western leaders,

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:41.260
Putin doesn't usually appear in public

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:42.583
with his family members.

00:00:42.583 --> 00:00:45.116
Images like this one, from state media,

00:00:45.116 --> 00:00:49.630
showing Putin on holiday
with his family in 2002,

00:00:49.630 --> 00:00:50.670
are rare.

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:54.950
In April, US officials
identified Katerina Tikhonova

00:00:54.950 --> 00:00:57.890
and Maria Vorontsova, as his daughters.

00:00:57.890 --> 00:01:00.411
They say one is a tech executive

00:01:00.411 --> 00:01:03.823
and the other works in genetics research.

00:01:03.823 --> 00:01:07.470
Both are his daughters from
his former wife, Lyudmila,

00:01:07.470 --> 00:01:09.160
according to the Kremlin.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:11.158
Putin doesn't discuss them publicly,

00:01:11.158 --> 00:01:13.220
and they keep such a low profile

00:01:13.220 --> 00:01:16.050
that many in Russia don't
even know what they look like.

00:01:16.050 --> 00:01:18.870
We also don't know whether
Putin has other children

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:19.800
or a partner.

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:23.400
Putin avoids talking about his
family for security reasons,

00:01:23.400 --> 00:01:26.706
according to Russia's
state news agency, TASS.

00:01:26.706 --> 00:01:28.962
And what about Putin's assets

00:01:28.962 --> 00:01:32.620
that Western officials say he's
hiding with family members?

00:01:32.620 --> 00:01:34.840
How much is Russia's president worth

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:36.280
and where is his wealth?

00:01:36.280 --> 00:01:40.960
Putin declared a salary
of about $130,000 in 2020,

00:01:41.820 --> 00:01:43.603
but his critics and political opponents

00:01:43.603 --> 00:01:47.110
have long said his wealth
is, in effect, much greater,

00:01:47.110 --> 00:01:48.913
because of the level of control and power

00:01:48.913 --> 00:01:50.771
he has in the country.

00:01:50.771 --> 00:01:54.188
(classical violin music)

